  "求人媒体": [
   {
    "quote": "Economically, although not suitable for consumption, Sen-nari Banana has ornamental market value. Its striking appearance enhances visitor engagement at exhibitions and botanical events. It is also used as fodder in some contexts, contributing to agricultural resources (Reference 2). Moreover, its display supports horticultural education and the dissemination of regional plant culture.",
